OL,3,ASerbia's VuDMiDG concedes election
OL,4,Adefeat to student-led protest movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FSerbia's long-standing leader
OL,7,FAleksandar VuDMiDG has conceded defeat
OL,8,Fto the student-led protest movement in
OL,9,Fthe country's snap parliamentary
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,F"We still do not have final results...
OL,13,Fit is clear that we have lost these
OL,14,Felections," the right-wing populist
OL,15,Fleader said late on Sunday.
OL,17,FPreliminary figures provided by
OL,18,FSerbia's election commission indicated
OL,19,Fa record high turnout, which
OL,20,Fcommentators had suggested would favour
OL,21,Fthe student movement.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
