OL,3,ASerbia's VuDMiDG concedes election
OL,4,Adefeat to student-led protest movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FVuDMiDG had called the snap elections
OL,7,Fafter two years of protests triggered
OL,8,Fby the 2024 collapse of a train station
OL,9,Fcanopy in the city of Novi Sad, which
OL,10,Fkilled 16 and was seen as emblematic of
OL,11,Fcorruption and negligence in Serbia.
